{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And the reservoir.</b> Like מקוה מים (Leviticus 11:36)." "<b>And you did not look to its maker.</b> That is HaShem, for He is the one who makes this decree, to bring Nebuchadnezzar." "<b>And who formed it.</b> The meaning is concerning the decree." "It is possible that <b>from afar</b> is connected with the word ויוצרה, and it is possible that it is connected with לא ראיתם."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:54:38.204352999Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}